This product includes a sliced copy of OpenCode’s agent loop and OpenAI-compatible
provider (packages/llm), plus a stdio MCP client derived from their MCP module.
TUI, desktop, IDE, and default shell/file tools are not included.

Also includes an adapted port of OpenCode's storage service (packages/opencode/
src/storage/storage.ts) and context-overflow pruning (packages/opencode/src/
session/compaction.ts, overflow.ts) — see vendor/opencode/storage/storage.js and
vendor/opencode/session/compaction.js for the specific substitutions made (their
private @opencode-ai/core internals and Git-based migrations are not included;
locking uses the public effect package's Semaphore rather than TxReentrantLock,
and the message schema is conxa-execute's own flat OpenAI-chat shape rather than
OpenCode's parts-based SessionV1 schema — full rationale in each file's header).

